            <p class="text-white font-inter font-thin text-[19px]">
                Have questions, feedback, or want to order our Braille keyboard? Send us a message and we’ll be happy to assist you.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-white font-orbitron text-[23px] text-left">Email:</h2>
            <p class="text-white font-inter font-thin text-[20px] tracking-wider">
                zerovisioncoding@gmail.com
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-white font-orbitron text-[23px] text-left">Phone:</h2>
            <p class="text-white font-inter font-thin text-[20px] tracking-wider">
                +63 912 3456 789
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-center items-center w-140 h-155 rounded-2xl p-5 bg-[#0a0a0f] border-darkgray border">
            <form class="flex flex-col gap-4" aria-required>
                <div class="flex flex-row gap-4">
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
